   <release>
      <date>2026-10-04</date>
      <version>
       <release>2.3.12</release>
       <api>2.3.12</api>
      </version>
      <stability>
       <release>stable</release>
       <api>stable</api>
      </stability>
      <notes>
       - xhprof.profiler INI setting: 0 skips observer registration and
         removes idle per-call overhead; enable functions fail with warning.
       - Long symbols no longer truncate/merge; sampling uses heap buffer.
       - xhprof.auto_enable(+flags); typed arginfo; phpinfo runtime state.
       - Reports: faster sorting, approximate flame graph, callgrind and
         JSON/CSV export, compare-runs entry, percentage bars, typeahead cap.
       - New CLI: bin/xhprof-report, bin/xhprof-diff; Docker quick start;
         XHGui recipe; ZTS static TSRMLS cache.
       - Phabricator-era support/ tooling removed.
      </notes>
   </release>

   <release>
      <date>2026-10-03</date>
      <version>
       <release>2.3.11</release>
       <api>2.3.11</api>
      </version>
      <stability>
       <release>stable</release>
       <api>stable</api>
      </stability>
      <notes>
       - Security: fix XSS via URL parameters and report data; fix path
         traversal and PHP object injection in the web UI.
       - Crash fixes: SIGSEGV with non-array xhprof_enable() options,
         ignored_functions "main()", and SQL/curl trace callbacks; SIGFPE
         with xhprof.sampling_interval=0; recursion counter drift fixed.
       - Robustness: malformed run data no longer returns HTTP 500.
       - Verified on PHP 8.3, 8.4, 8.5 and 8.6 (RC2); add tests xhprof_014~018.
       - CI moved to GitHub Actions; bilingual README; packaging refresh.
      </notes>
   </release>

